<figure class="time-explainer">
  <div class="time-figure-heading">
    <span>Time online</span>
    <span>Logged in & available</span>
  </div>
  <div class="time-bracket" aria-hidden="true">
    <span></span>
  </div>
  <div
    class="time-map"
    role="img"
    aria-label="Engaged time fulfilling an offer is part of the broader online time, which also includes waiting between offers. This schematic is not to scale."
  >
    <div class="waiting">
      <span>
        Waiting
        <br />
        for an order
      </span>
    </div>
    <div class="engaged">
      <span class="figure-arrow" aria-hidden="true">
        ↗
      </span>
      <strong>Engaged time</strong>
      <span>Fulfilling an offer</span>
    </div>
    <div class="waiting">
      <span>
        Available
        <br />
        again
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="time-definition">
    <p>
      <strong>Per engaged hour</strong>
      <br />
      Earnings divided by time fulfilling offers.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Per online hour</strong>
      <br />
      Earnings divided by all time logged in and available.
    </p>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    Schematic only. Blocks are not to scale and show no measured durations or
    earnings. The earnings definition must also be held consistent when
    comparing hourly measures.
  </figcaption>
</figure>
